{"id":"n28148-1-7","stage":1,"title":"코끼리 · 大象","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28148-1-7-1","ko":"저기 코가 긴 동물이 바로 코끼리야.","zh":"那边鼻子长长的动物就是大象哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저기","meaning":"那里，那儿","explanation":"저기：那里，那儿","readings":[{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71218","senseId":"1","lemma":"저기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"코가","meaning":"鼻，鼻子","explanation":"코：鼻，鼻子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"코","audio":"/audio/f4f759edb468db531ae2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46814","senseId":"1","lemma":"코","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"긴","meaning":"长","explanation":"길다：长；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"길다","audio":"/audio/013e520a738e476f5fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26808","senseId":"1","lemma":"길다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"동물이","meaning":"动物","explanation":"동물：动物；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"동물","audio":"/audio/227e25cceb2f8449c2a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70747","senseId":"1","lemma":"동물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바로","meaning":"正，就","explanation":"바로：正，就","readings":[{"term":"바로","audio":"/audio/a441b444c56119c0f154.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64744","senseId":"6","lemma":"바로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"코끼리야.","meaning":"大象","explanation":"코끼리：大象；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"코끼리","audio":"/audio/6504c4e0dfbf5051694d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28148","senseId":"1","lemma":"코끼리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1a8b5723b01cfd93","term":"저기","zh":"那里，那儿","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3","entryId":"71218","definition":"指代离说话人或听话人很远的地方。","pronunciation":["저기"]},{"id":"f4f759edb468db53","term":"코","zh":"鼻，鼻子","audio":"/audio/f4f759edb468db531ae2.mp3","entryId":"46814","definition":"用于呼吸、闻味儿的身体的一个部位。","pronunciation":["코"]},{"id":"013e520a738e476f","term":"길다","zh":"长","audio":"/audio/013e520a738e476f5fd9.mp3","entryId":"26808","definition":"从物体的一端到另一端相距甚远。","pronunciation":["길ː다"]},{"id":"227e25cceb2f8449","term":"동물","zh":"动物","audio":"/audio/227e25cceb2f8449c2a4.mp3","entryId":"70747","definition":"在生物界的两条分支中，从食物中获取营养，并可以自由活动的生物。","pronunciation":["동ː물"]},{"id":"a441b444c56119c0","term":"바로","zh":"正，就","audio":"/audio/a441b444c56119c0f154.mp3","entryId":"64744","definition":"不是别的，正是。","pronunciation":["바로"]},{"id":"6504c4e0dfbf5051","term":"코끼리","zh":"大象","audio":"/audio/6504c4e0dfbf5051694d.mp3","entryId":"28148","definition":"陆地上最大的动物，有着长长的鼻子和两个外露的大牙。","pronunciation":["코끼리"]}],"audio":"/audio/0efb47bed86c5cb3e056.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n28148-1-7-2","ko":"와! 코로 음식을 집어 먹네요.","zh":"哇！它居然用鼻子来抓食物吃呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"와!","meaning":"啊，咦","explanation":"와：啊，咦","readings":[{"term":"와","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17872","senseId":"1","lemma":"와","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"코로","meaning":"鼻，鼻子","explanation":"코：鼻，鼻子；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"코","audio":"/audio/f4f759edb468db531ae2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46814","senseId":"1","lemma":"코","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"음식을","meaning":"食物，食品","explanation":"음식：食物，食品；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"음식","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71114","senseId":"2","lemma":"음식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"집어","meaning":"握，拿","explanation":"집다：握，拿；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"집다","audio":"/audio/c839e6d0bfca40874b6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71575","senseId":"1","lemma":"집다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹네요.","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d536e6255a4151ea","term":"와","zh":"啊，咦","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3","entryId":"17872","definition":"遇到惊喜时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["와"]},{"id":"f4f759edb468db53","term":"코","zh":"鼻，鼻子","audio":"/audio/f4f759edb468db531ae2.mp3","entryId":"46814","definition":"用于呼吸、闻味儿的身体的一个部位。","pronunciation":["코"]},{"id":"2e144916046c2a6f","term":"음식","zh":"食物，食品","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3","entryId":"71114","definition":"可供人们吃喝的东西。","pronunciation":["음ː식"]},{"id":"c839e6d0bfca4087","term":"집다","zh":"握，拿","audio":"/audio/c839e6d0bfca40874b6f.mp3","entryId":"71575","definition":"用手指或脚趾抓起物品。","pronunciation":["집따"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]}],"audio":"/audio/d14a8a3a5e7e327d9116.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.15,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=28148","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":42,"sequenceScore":1.8753,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["那边鼻子长长的动物就是大象哦。","哇！它居然用鼻子来抓食物吃呢。","那个，我现在没有硬币。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["那边鼻子长长的动物就是大象哦。","哇！它居然用鼻子来抓食物吃呢。","那个，我现在没有硬币。"],"answer":1}]}
